      {
        "met_days": 8,
        "type": "edl_or_oi",
        "label": "Lunar powered descent + sample collection — Mare Fecunditatis",
        "description": "1970-09-20. Soft landing in the Sea of Fertility (0.51°S, 56.36°E). Extendable drill arm collected 101 g of regolith from a depth of ~35 cm — the first robotic sample return from another world."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 9,
        "type": "arrival",
        "label": "Ascent + Earth return — Kazakhstan",
        "description": "Ascender lifted off 1970-09-21 with the sample capsule. Capsule re-entered Earth's atmosphere 1970-09-24, parachuted to landing in Kazakhstan. Samples scientifically analysed in the USSR + later partially exchanged with NASA for Apollo samples."
